   "description": "This report summarizes the first NICEST2 hackathon with FAIR experts and Earth System Model specialists to understand what needs to be done to make climate data FAIR. It will help us to define our roadmap for FAIR Climate in the Nordics.",
   "license": {
    "@id": "https://choosealicense.com/no-permission/"
   },
   "name": "NICEST2 - D3.3: Report on NICEST2 FAIR climate data hackathon",
   "sdDatePublished": "2023-01-08 21:03:28.636733+00:00"
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5571344",
   "@type": [
